repository-code: "https://github.com/bertoletlab/topas-rpt"
abstract: >-
  An OpenTOPAS extension for time-resolved Monte Carlo simulation of
  radioactive decay chains and radioligand binding kinetics, for
  radiopharmaceutical therapy dosimetry. Explicit decay-chain time structure
  and voxelized DICOM activity maps, alongside a compartmental in-vitro
  binding kinetics model validated against cell viability data.
keywords:
  - radiopharmaceutical therapy
  - Monte Carlo
  - OpenTOPAS
  - Geant4
  - dosimetry
  - radioactive decay chains
